    "head_branch": "claude/magical-davinci-mca7zh",
    "head_commit_message": "perf(formation): wounds weigh only the standing near a downed body\n\nFormationWounds.tend drew, sorted and gridded every standing unit each\ntick a body lay down. Its takers, the body's guards and the takers' foes\nall stand within wounds_reach + wounds_guard_reach of a downed body, so\nit now keeps only the standing in the cells that reach covers: its cost\ngrows with the downed and those near them. Choices are the same: the\nstanding kept are sorted by the same draws, and the dropped could never\ntake, guard or hold a taker. The standard digest is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E3rJWSqvkcCzMoGnLiZBk1",
    "head_sha": "374835ff33c9624c9fc6106a364d0ccc5bd6a762",
